# qwen-blocks qfd_hub_ps2x: 2x area frame (owner-approved hub area doubling; pin regions scaled x1.414) + ar / link-output pin stations (+1 each way) and fck-domain pin register of the returned-credit Gray count (PS=1)
# r21 master qfd_hub (412.536 x 412.536): ot_qwen_die_hub_top = 4 stack-link endpoints (credit CDC from each forwarded
# link clock, Gray credit return in the tx control) + x3 / ar registered staging (die-top answer 2026-10-07);
# multi-clock kit mc/qfd_hub, every port 150 ps.  Pins on the E face in the r21 order (lsw, x3, ar, lse, ln).
TOP=ot_qwen_die_hub_top
SRCS='rtl/physical/ot_qwen_die_hub.sv rtl/physical/ot_qwen_die_cdc_ch.sv rtl/lib/ot_async_fifo.sv rtl/lib/ot_reset_sync.sv'
PARAMS=(--param PS=1)
FW=583.416
FH=583.416
PINS=(--pin-region '^l2_(i|o)(\[|$)=right:6-88' --pin-region '^x3_(v|d|tag|cr)(\[|$)=right:91-170' --pin-region '^ar_(v|d|cr)(\[|$)=right:173-252' --pin-region '^l3_(i|o)(\[|$)=right:255-337' --pin-region '^l0_(i|o)(\[|$)=right:339-457' --pin-region '^l1_(i|o)(\[|$)=right:460-577' --pin-region '^(ck|fck0|fck1|fck2|fck3|rst_n|fault)$=top:141-424')
INTER='*'
REFGLOB='*ard_q*'
CLKPORT=ck
QDMD=/src/physical/qwen_die_masters/mc/qfd_hub
SDCF=plain.sdc
PD=0.55
NC=16
MACROS=()
EXTRA=()
STAGES=synth,pnr
